# issue-flow — run hands-off (`/iflow-run`)

Run the normal lifecycle (pick → plan → build → close) without per-step checkpoints. Every mode asks **once** up front{% if hands_off %} (`hands_off = true`: that confirm is already authorized){% endif %}, then stops only when input is strictly necessary. No mode weakens a safeguard to keep moving.

